  "releaseNotes": "[Version 9.5.5.0] - Updated on Sep 18th 2025:\n---\n(1) Some refactoring of classes, removed unused constants and code.\n(2) Added support for FOREIGN KEYS (see TableColumnAttribute, use TypeOfKey = Foreign, and set the two Referenced* properties).\n(3) Updated code across Builders to work with FOREIGN KEYS.",
